[stderr] authoring B-series tasks per wave, creates one successor dispatcher, and stops.
[stderr] Each authoring task instructs Codex to create only its assigned R-series
[stderr] implementation runbooks under
[stderr] `projects/<project-slug>/runbooks/`, then validate their metadata and update the
[stderr] manifest. The successor dispatcher repeats this process until no queued
[stderr] catalogue chapter or unassigned implementation contract remains. Generate an
[stderr] `INITIAL.md` context document in `authoring-runbooks/`
[stderr] that points to the canonical `PROJECT_BRIEF.md` and specification.
