[stderr] `{"runbooks_dir": "../projects/<project-slug>/authoring-runbooks"}`. Also
[stderr] write `authoring-runbooks/.supervisor-children/implementation.json` containing
[stderr] `{"runbooks_dir": "../runbooks"}`. These are explicit child-collection
[stderr] registrations; `supervisor-run --run-all` follows them automatically after the
[stderr] parent collection is accepted.
