[stderr] Every dispatcher first expands at most one queued specification/catalogue domain
[stderr] chapter (maximum 250 `IMP-*` contracts), validates its coverage, then allocates
[stderr] ready contracts. If any queued chapter or ready contract remains, it creates no
[stderr] more than ten authoring tasks and exactly one successor dispatcher. If none
[stderr] remains, it creates the final audit task instead. This is a durable loop, not a
[stderr] recursive prompt or an unbounded single run.
