[stderr] and contain: precise objective; dependencies; relevant requirement IDs; owned
[stderr] files/data/interfaces; required behaviour; non-goals; platform differences;
[stderr] verification commands/evidence; and observable acceptance criteria. It must be
[stderr] small enough for one implementation task, not a vague epic.
